+# CONTRACT — T9 SSG Toolkit (8 plugins)
+
+Each plugin exports a `createXxxPlugin(): Plugin` factory. Behavior is defined by
+`tests/plugins/*.test.ts` (60 tests) + 15 existing core tests must still pass.
+
+## Wave 1
+
+### markdown-ext (deps: none)
+- [ ] basic markdown → HTML (`<h1>`, `<strong>bold</strong>`) -> markdown-ext.test
+- [ ] footnote ref `[^1]` → `<sup><a href="#fn-1">1</a></sup>`
+- [ ] footnote defs → `<section class="footnotes">` with `<li id="fn-1">text</li>`
+- [ ] `:::note/:::warning/:::tip` → `<div class="admonition admonition-X">` w/ body
+- [ ] preserves existing HTML; handles empty content
+
+### asset-pipeline (deps: none)
+- [ ] rewrite `src/href="./x"` → `/assets/x`; leave absolute URLs alone
+- [ ] manifest in `ctx.data['asset-manifest'] = { assets: [...] }`, accumulates across files
+- [ ] no refs → content unchanged (toBe); already-`/assets/` → no double-process, no manifest
+
+### syntax-highlight (deps: none)
+- [ ] `<pre><code class="language-X">` → add `highlighted` class + `data-language="X"` on `<pre>`
+- [ ] no-language `<pre><code>` unchanged; inline `<code>` unchanged; preserves content; empty block ok
+
+### taxonomy (deps: none)
+- [ ] beforeBuild builds `ctx.data['taxonomy-tags'] = Map<tag, ContentFile[]>`, lowercased
+- [ ] afterBuild writes `tags/<tag>.html` listing file titles; no tags → map size 0
+
+## Wave 2
+
+### rss-feed (deps: markdown-ext, taxonomy)
+- [ ] afterBuild → `feed.xml` valid RSS 2.0 (xml decl, `<rss version="2.0">`, channel, item, `</rss>`)
+- [ ] item description = content in CDATA; categories from tags; channel `<title>` from config
+- [ ] sorted newest-first by date; no `<pubDate>undefined</pubDate>`; links use baseUrl
+
+### search-index (deps: markdown-ext, syntax-highlight)
+- [ ] afterBuild → `search-index.json` array of {title, slug, content(plain text), tags?}
+- [ ] HTML stripped from content; code blocks included; empty list → `[]`; valid JSON
+
+## Wave 3
+
+### sitemap (deps: taxonomy, rss-feed)
+- [ ] afterBuild → `sitemap.xml` valid urlset; includes all output URLs (pages, tags, feed.xml) w/ baseUrl
+- [ ] no tag pages → no `/tags/`
+
+### dev-server (deps: asset-pipeline, search-index)
+- [ ] afterBuild → `ctx.data['dev-server-config']`: { port:3000, routes, assetPaths, searchIndexPath }
+- [ ] static routes per .html output; asset routes from manifest; missing manifest → assetPaths []
+
+## Validation
+- [ ] `npm test` → 75 pass
+- [ ] `npm run build` clean
+- [ ] `npm run lint` clean
